{"text": "THE TOBACCO INSTITUTE\n\n1875 1 STREET, NORTHWEST TADA V. SMITH\n\u2018WASHINGTON. DC 20008 Media Relations Coordinator\n202/487-4862 + 800/425-0676\n\nFebruary 18, 1992\n\nThe Jenny Jones Show\nAttention: Dana\nSenior Producer\nP.O. Box 3333\nChicago, IL 60654\n\nDear Senior Producer:\n\nMore than twenty years ago, cigarette advertising left the airwaves. Now, the\ntobacco industry is supporting a new television campaign with a very simple\nmessage: kids shouldn't smoke.\n\nNo one wants kids to smoke. And, we're willing to surprise a few people to\nunderscore our commitment that smoking shouldn't be a part of growing up.\n\nIn the most recent expansion of ongoing efforts, The Tobacco Institute provided\ngrants for anti-youth-smoking television spots. These public service announcements\nhave just been distributed to television stations across the country by a group of\neducation and youth experts. These experts, who together form the Family\nCOURSE Consortium, are encouraging television stations to air the spots\nfrequently.\n\nEnclosed is a brief package of information on this latest ces ee by The Tobacco\nInstitute to discourage youth smoking. We would/welcome the opportunity to\ndiscuss this and other successful programs. J i/\n\nSh\n( )\nEnclosures U\n\nTIMN 408686", "words": [{"text": "THE", "x0": 164, "y0": 80, "x1": 213, "y1": 98, "conf": 91.0}, {"text": "TOBACCO", "x0": 220, "y0": 79, "x1": 331, "y1": 98, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "INSTITUTE", "x0": 337, "y0": 79, "x1": 467, "y1": 98, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "1875", "x0": 334, "y0": 105, "x1": 354, "y1": 112, "conf": 79.0}, {"text": "1", "x0": 358, "y0": 105, "x1": 360, "y1": 112, "conf": 80.0}, {"text": "STREET,", "x0": 364, "y0": 104, "x1": 400, "y1": 112, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "NORTHWEST", "x0": 405, "y0": 104, "x1": 468, "y1": 112, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "TADA", "x0": 597, "y0": 103, "x1": 620, "y1": 112, "conf": 88.0}, {"text": "V.", "x0": 624, "y0": 103, "x1": 630, "y1": 110, "conf": 55.0}, 